## Name of the node
-name a2a@127.0.0.1

## Cookie for distributed erlang
-setcookie a2a_cookie

## Heartbeat management
## Disabled by default to avoid unexpected restarts
## +K true

## Enable SMP
+S 4:4

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
+Q 65536

## Increase process count
+P 1000000

## Enable kernel poll
+K true

## Schedulers online
+sbt db

## Use async threads
+A 64

## Garbage collection
+hms 233

## Allocator settings for memory efficiency
+MBas aobf
+MBlmbcs 512
+MEas aobf
